  <item nodeId="node-0x565284aa8800">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look at basket</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(the wicker basket)
It&apos;s a wicker basket, about 50 centimetres long and half as wide. It is currently sealed by two combination locks. A kingfisher sits perched atop the basket, apparently guarding it. The bird eyes you expectantly, as if waiting for you to speak.

&gt;</result>
